<DocsLayout
  title="Execution model: three tiers, zero forks"
  description="The niubash engine replicates fork's semantics, not its mechanism: in-process subshells, a real-handle fd table (POSIX dup semantics), real processes only at boundaries; 62 real builtins + 12 inlined coreutils + pipeline-inline arms — observable behavior identical to GNU Bash."
  path="/en/docs/execution-model/"
  lang="en"
  enPath="/docs/execution-model/"
